# Optional server endpoint for live Khora AI responses.
# Keep the Anthropic API key on that server; never add it to this file.
EXPO_PUBLIC_KHORA_AI_ENDPOINT=https://your-server.example.com/api/khora-ai

# Optional Google Places API (New) key for accurate, photo-rich supplier
# results on the Suppliers tab. Without this, the app falls back to the free
# OpenStreetMap Overpass/Nominatim search (no photos, lower data quality).
#
# Setup (only you can do this — it needs your own Google account):
#   1. Create/select a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Enable "Places API (New)" for that project (APIs & Services > Library).
#   3. Enable billing on the project (Google gives ~$200/month free credit,
#      which comfortably covers a small app's usage).
#   4. Create an API key (APIs & Services > Credentials > Create Credentials
#      > API key).
#   5. IMPORTANT — restrict the key so it can't be abused if someone extracts
#      it from the app bundle: API restrictions > limit to "Places API (New)"
#      only, and Application restrictions > Android apps (add your package
#      name + SHA-1) / iOS apps (add your bundle ID) / HTTP referrers (for
#      the web build, restrict to your deployed domain(s)).
#   6. Paste the key below.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
